diff --git a/.asd/rules/providers.md b/.asd/rules/providers.md
index 8871c54..b90b483 100644
--- a/.asd/rules/providers.md
+++ b/.asd/rules/providers.md
@@ -120,10 +120,10 @@ Section scope inside a granted file: `artifact-layout.md` "HTML shell wrapping (
 
